-- 46 built-in notebooks: slug + canonical naming ---------
-- Matched on slug, OR on a legacy title when the target has no slug yet.
-- That second case matters: a deployment seeded before P2 never ran the
-- classification pass, so its notebooks are still called "Ielts Hard 2"
-- with slug NULL. Without this the tag assignments below join on a slug
-- that does not exist and silently insert nothing.
-- A notebook missing entirely is left alone; the seed there creates it.
