  ('ameliorate', 'cải thiện, làm tốt hơn', 'to make something bad better', 'cải thiện, làm tốt hơn', 'improve, enhance, alleviate', '/əˈmiːliəreɪt/', NULL),
  ('amend', 'verb: to make small changes to improve', 'verb: to make small changes to improve', 'sửa đổi, tu chỉnh', 'modify, revise, alter', '/əˈmend/', 'The lawyer suggested amending the current contract rather than starting work on an entirely new deal.'),
