  ('dilemma', NULL, 'a situation in which a difficult choice has to be made between two different things you could do', 'Thế tiến lui đều khó, thế tiến thoái lưỡng nan, tình trạng khó xử.', 'predicament', '/dɪˈlemə/', 'The president is clearly in a dilemma about/over how to tackle the crisis. She faces the dilemma of disobeying her father or losing the man she loves. a moral/ethical dilemma'),
