  ('disingenuous', 'adjective: dishonest or not giving the whole truth', 'adjective: dishonest or not giving the whole truth', 'không thành thật', NULL, NULL, 'The public could not trust their disingenuous leader, as he was infamous for avoiding direct answers to question in every interview.'),
