  ('disturbing', NULL, 'making you feel anxious and upset or shocked', 'tạo cảm giác lo lắng, sợ hãi, hoặc sốc', '', ' /dɪˈstɜːrbɪŋ/', 'a disturbing piece of news a profoundly disturbing experience'),
  ('diverse', 'adjective: having many different types', 'adjective: having many different types', 'đa dạng, phong phú', 'varied, heterogeneous, manifold', '/dɪˈvɜrs/', 'The student population is incredibly diverse at South State University, with students from 30 different countries.'),
