  ('do your level best', NULL, 'try as hard as you can to do something', 'hãy cố gắng hết sức mình', '', '', 'The President told American troops that he would do his level best to bring them home soon.'),
  ('domesticate', 'thuần hóa', 'to tame an animal or cultivate a plant for human use', 'thuần hóa', 'tame, cultivate', '/də mɛst.ə.keɪt/', NULL),
