  ('flaunt', NULL, 'to show something you are proud of to other people, in order to impress them', 'khoe khoang, phô trương, chưng diện', '', '/flɔːnt/ ', 'He did not believe in flaunting his wealth. She openly flaunted her affair with the senator. He''s got a lot of money but he doesn''t flaunt it.'),
