  ('food chain', NULL, 'a series of living things that are connected because each group of things eats the group below it in the chain', 'chuỗi thức ăn', '', '/ˈfuːd ˌtʃeɪn/', 'Insects are fairly low down (on) the food chain. Pesticides work their way up the food chain from plants, through insects and birds to humans.'),
