  ('freedom of speech', 'tự do ngôn luận', NULL, 'tự do ngôn luận', NULL, '/ˈfriːdəm əv spiːtʃ/', NULL),
  ('freezing', NULL, 'extremely cold', 'Giá lạnh, băng giá, rét lắm.', '', ' /ˈfriːzɪŋ/', 'It''s freezing in here - can I close the window? They survived for four hours in the freezing water. After walking through the snow, my feet were freezing. I had to wait for hours on the freezing cold station platform.'),
