  ('from the horse’s mouth', NULL, 'get information directly from someone who is involved in it and knows the most about it', 'từ chính nguồn tin đáng tin cậy', '', '', 'When he tells them, straight from the horse’s mouth, what a good assistant you are, they’ll increase your wages.'),
