  ('function', 'verb: to work; to do what something should do; noun: what something does, its purpose', 'verb: to work; to do what something should do; noun: what something does, its purpose', 'hàm', NULL, NULL, 'I dropped my phone into a swimming pool, but it still functions, amazingly.
