  ('generate', 'verb: to create; to produce (especially energy)', 'verb: to create; to produce (especially energy)', 'tạo ra, sản sinh', 'produce, spawn, engender', '/dʒɪˈneɪ.ɪt/', 'Movement generates heat.'),
