  ('gesture', 'cử chỉ; động thái', 'a movement of the body to express meaning; an action', 'cử chỉ; động thái', 'signal, motion, indication', '/ˈdʒɛs.tʃər/', NULL),
  ('get (come) to grips with something', NULL, 'start to deal with something effectively, usually by making an effort to understand it', 'hiểu rõ, nắm bắt được điều gì đó', '', '', 'The present government has completely failed to get to grips with our economic problems.'),
  ('get a kick out of something', NULL, '[INFORMAL] enjoy something very much', 'thấy thích thú với điều gì đó', '', '', 'These doctors take on huge workloads and get a kick out of being busy, helping people, curing patients and saving lives.'),
  ('get on top of you', NULL, 'something makes you feel sad or upset, and you are not able to deal with it', 'đè lên người bạn', '', '', 'I was so fed up. Everything was just getting on top of me.'),
  ('get rid of', NULL, 'to remove or throw away something unwanted', 'tống khứ', '', '', 'That cream got rid of my skin rash. I used weedkiller to get rid of the weeds in the garden.'),
