  ('however', 'used to introduce a statement that contrasts with what was just said', 'used to introduce a statement that contrasts with what was just said', 'tuy nhiên', 'nevertheless, nonetheless, yet', '/haʊˈev.ər/', 'The policy is popular. However, it is expensive to run.'),
  ('hue', 'noun: a color', 'noun: a color', 'hue', NULL, NULL, 'We watched from our campsite on top of the mountain as the sun set and changed the hue of the sky to the colors of a peach.'),
