  ('rebate', NULL, 'an amount of money that is returned to you, especially by the government, for example when you have paid too much tax', 'tiền bồi hoàn, tiền trả (sau thuế)', '', '/ˈriːbeɪt/', 'She’s claiming a 100% tax rebate. The maximum cash rebate available is about $4 800. rebates on the new council tax You may be entitled to a rebate on your car insurance.'),
